   "text": "React, Vite, strict TypeScript, Fluent UI v9 and pdf.js. Generated Dataverse services run with the signed-in reviewer's permissions,\nwith no custom tokens. Screens: the contract list, the evidence viewer (findings beside the PDF, click to highlight), accept, correct or\nreject, approve, and Ask this contract.",
   "originalText": "React, Vite, strict TypeScript, Fluent UI v9 and pdf.js. Generated Dataverse services run with the signed-in reviewer's permissions,\nwith no custom tokens. Screens: the contract list, the evidence viewer (findings beside the PDF, click to highlight), accept, correct or\nreject, approve, and Ask this contract.",
