   "text": "The Function sends the PDF to the Content Understanding analyzer as its managed identity and polls it. It maps the result to 20 findings: value, verbatim clause, page,\npolygon, confidence and presence. A finding is Found only with a clause, a page and enough confidence.",
   "originalText": "The Function sends the PDF to the Content Understanding analyzer as its managed identity and polls it. It maps the result to 20 findings: value, verbatim clause, page,\npolygon, confidence and presence. A finding is Found only with a clause, a page and enough confidence.",
