   "text": "The Function embeds the question and runs a hybrid keyword and vector search in Azure AI Search, filtered to this contract and its content version. It keeps the best 12\npassages.",
   "originalText": "The Function embeds the question and runs a hybrid keyword and vector search in Azure AI Search, filtered to this contract and its content version. It keeps the best 12\npassages.",
