   "text": "The Function checks every quote against the retrieved passages and the original page. If one does not match it asks the agent once more, then rejects the answer. No\nevidence gives Not Addressed. The flow saves the answer and the app shows it with page links.",
   "originalText": "The Function checks every quote against the retrieved passages and the original page. If one does not match it asks the agent once more, then rejects the answer. No\nevidence gives Not Addressed. The flow saves the answer and the app shows it with page links.",
